      "id": 222441,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-09-22T01:17:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We'll usually go with whatever makes the most sense at the time. FF Legacy is useful if you don't want to deal with the Representative, for example; use his power to get rid of it and it likely won't be an issue, again. We found Guise to be pretty useful (and comical ![](upload://lNCUQFYSA7ZMqVCMtPuFwzz40RT.gif)), along with Requital CC (as zelink551 mentioned). If healing is needed, base Sentinels Medico is good. And so on...</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-13T02:23:03.611Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
