      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>We'll usually go with whatever makes the most sense at the time. FF Legacy is useful if you don't want to deal with the Representative, for example; use his power to get rid of it and it likely won't be an issue, again. We found Guise to be pretty useful (and comical ![](upload://lNCUQFYSA7ZMqVCMtPuFwzz40RT.gif)), along with Requital CC (as zelink551 mentioned). If healing is needed, base Sentinels Medico is good. And so on...</p>",
